   The new `ac-6` tests only check `non-zero` + message text, while the inherited trait AC requires a specific exit code (`1`) plus usage info. The later test at `tests/session-log-show.test.ts:800` also asserts `USAGE_ERROR = 2`, which further shows the mismatch. This is weaker/mislabeled AC coverage.

3. SHOULD-FIX — `tests/session-log-show.test.ts:800`  
   The test comments/title claim it verifies documented exit-code meanings and named-constant usage, but it only black-box checks numeric CLI exit codes. Useful behavior test, but not direct `ac-8` documentation/implementation verification.

